msgid "What is Hunting?"
msgstr "什麼是狩獵？"

msgid "Hunting is a Skill that tasks you to hunt a variety of wild Animals & Beasts in order to acquire their rewards.\n\nHunting feeds directly into [b]Beastcrafting[/b] as its primary use, while also rewarding you with various other Items such as [b]Herb Seeds[/b] and [b]Bones[/b]"
msgstr "狩獵是一項讓你獵捕各種野生動物與野獸以取得獎勵的技能。\n\n狩獵的主要用途是直接供應[b]野獸工藝[/b]，同時也會獎勵你各種其他物品，例如[b]藥草種子[/b]與[b]骨頭[/b]"

msgid "What do I do?"
msgstr "我該做什麼？"

msgid "Before you can hunt, you must craft a Trap in Crafting.\n\nEach Animal requires a specific Trap, which is listed in Hunting when you select the Animal.\n\nYou can then hunt the Animal, which is an automatic 3-step process, rewarding you with Skill XP and Items upon successfully trapping the Animal."
msgstr "狩獵前，你必須先在工藝中製作陷阱。\n\n每種動物都需要特定的陷阱，選擇該動物時會在狩獵中列出。\n\n接著你就能狩獵該動物，這是一個自動進行的 3 步驟流程，成功捕獲動物後會獎勵技能經驗與物品。"

msgid "The automatic 3-step Hunting process"
msgstr "自動進行的 3 步驟狩獵流程"

msgid "Step 1 - Surveying\n[ul]Search the location to find the Animal’s tracks.[/ul]\n\nStep 2 - Tracking\n[ul]YFollow the tracks to locate the Animal.[/ul]\n\nStep 3 - Trapping\n[ul]Use your crafted Trap and attempt to catch it.\nFailing sends the Animal fleeing, returning you to Tracking.[/ul]"
msgstr "步驟 1 - 勘查\n[ul]搜索地點以找到動物的蹤跡。[/ul]\n\n步驟 2 - 追蹤\n[ul]跟隨蹤跡找到動物。[/ul]\n\n步驟 3 - 誘捕\n[ul]使用你製作的陷阱嘗試捕捉。\n失敗會讓動物逃走，並回到追蹤階段。[/ul]"

msgid "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] is calculated as the average of these 3 substats:"
msgstr "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]為以下 3 項子屬性的平均值："

msgid "Hunger"
msgstr "飢餓"

msgid "[ul]Keep your Animals fed every hour.\nLose 10% every hour an Animal is not fed.\nReplenish to 100% when fed.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]每小時餵食你的動物。\n動物每小時未被餵食會損失 10%。\n餵食後回復至 100%。[/ul]"

msgid "Comfort"
msgstr "舒適"

msgid "[ul]Keep Enclosures repaired as they degrade by 1% every hour.\nThis does not affect Animal's Happiness until it falls below 75%.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]圍欄每小時會損耗 1%，請保持修繕。\n低於 75% 前不會影響動物的幸福度。[/ul]"

msgid "Satisfaction"
msgstr "滿足"

msgid "[ul]Animals have unique needs that can be met to boost Satisfaction.\nManaging this allows Happiness to increase above 100%.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]動物有各自獨特的需求，滿足後可提升滿足度。\n妥善管理可讓幸福度超過 100%。[/ul]"

msgid "[color=green]Begin the Skill by purchasing your first plot of [b][color=white]Land[/color][/b] and building an [b][color=white]Enclosure[/color][/b].[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]購買你的第一塊[b][color=white]土地[/color][/b]並建造一座[b][color=white]圍欄[/color][/b]，開始這項技能。[/color]"

msgid "Base Cost:"
msgstr "基礎消耗："

