msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Thank you for joining us during [color=FFD16D]Steam Next Fest[/color]!\n\nMelvor Idle 2 is still in active development, and the version you're about to play is an [color=FFD16D]early limited look at the game[/color]. Many systems, features, visuals, and balance are still being developed and refined as we work towards an Early Access release.\n\nFor this demo, progression is limited to [color=FFD16D]Level 60[/color], with only a limited selection of Skills and content available to test out. The Early Access release will have far more content available!\n\nAs this is an early build, you may encounter unfinished content, balance that isn't quite right, missing features, or bugs.\n\nYour feedback during Next Fest is incredibly valuable to us. We'd love to hear about your experience, any bugs you may have encountered, or general discussions around the game.\n\nMost importantly, have fun, explore, experiment, and enjoy your first steps into Melvor Idle 2!\n\nAnd remember - [color=FFD16D]Melvor Idle 2 is an idle game![/color] You can set your character on a task, let them make progress in the background, and check out some of the other great games taking part in Steam Next Fest. Melvor will be here when you get back!\n\nThank you for being part of the journey![/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs, Coolrox, Prat, Tapi & Ash[/color][/i]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]感謝你在 [color=FFD16D]Steam 新品節[/color]期間與我們同樂！\n\nMelvor Idle 2 仍在積極開發中，你即將遊玩的版本是[color=FFD16D]遊戲的早期有限搶先體驗[/color]。在我們朝搶先體驗版發行努力的過程中，許多系統、功能、畫面與平衡仍在開發和調整中。\n\n本試玩版的進度上限為[color=FFD16D]等級 60[/color]，且僅開放有限的技能與內容供測試。搶先體驗版將提供更多內容！\n\n由於這是早期版本，你可能會遇到未完成的內容、不夠完善的平衡、缺少的功能或錯誤。\n\n你在新品節期間的意見回饋對我們極為寶貴。我們很樂意聽到你的遊玩體驗、你遇到的任何錯誤，或任何關於遊戲的討論。\n\n最重要的是，盡情享受、探索、嘗試，享受你踏入 Melvor Idle 2 的第一步！\n\n還有別忘了——[color=FFD16D]Melvor Idle 2 是一款放置遊戲！[/color]你可以讓角色執行任務、在背景持續進展，同時去看看其他參與 Steam 新品節的精彩遊戲。等你回來時，Melvor 依然在這裡！\n\n感謝你參與這段旅程！[/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs, Coolrox, Prat, Tapi & Ash[/color][/i]"

